<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">1 Johan</book>
  <para style="h">1 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Johan</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Johan</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A chiil a kipat a umsa, ka zahsa uh, ka mit ua ka musa uh, ka etsa uh leh ka khut ua ka thamsa uh, tua hinna Thu khu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua hinna khu akilangta a, kouten ka muta ua, ka theipi ua, tualeh tua kumtawn hinna Pa kunga um, ka kung ua suhlat a um khu noute kungah ka phuong uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nouten zong koute toh kipawlkhawmna na nei theina dingun, ka musa u’leh ka zahsa uh noute kunga hing phuongkhie ka hi uhi, tualeh adihtahin ikipawlkhawmna u’khu Pa toh a Tapa Jesu Khrist toh kipawlkhawmna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh na kipahna uh akimtheina dingin tam thute na kung uah ka hing giel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tami Ama akipata ka zah uh, na kung ua kang gen sawn uh thupuoh ahi, Pasian khu vah ahia Ama ah miel mawngmawng a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama toh kipawlkhawmna ka nei uh chi ngal a miel a igamtat leh zuou gen ihi ua, thutah zui a gamta ihi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Ama vah a aum banga eite zong vah a i um leh, khat leh khat kipawlkhawmna i nei a, A Tapa Jesu Khrist sisan in khelna zousie apat eite ahing siengsah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khelna ka nei sih ichi leh, eima leh eima kisol ihi ua, thutah eima ah aum sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I khelnate i phuon u’leh ikhelnate ngaidam ding leh, dihtatlouna zousie akipat hing siengsah dingin Ama amuonhuoi in adihtat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khelna ka nei sih ichi leh Ama mi zuou ihisah a, tualeh athu zong eima ah a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka ta ittahte aw, na khellouna dingun tam thute na kung uah ka hing giel hi. Tualeh mi koi ahiei akhel taah leh, Pa kunga hing genpiehpa Jesu Khrist midihtat inei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama pen i khelnate dinga thupha tawina ahi, eite khelna guoh hilou in leitung pumpi khelna thupha tawina zong ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama thupiehte i zuia ahileh, tamnah Ama i thei hi chi i thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ama ka thei” chi ngal a athupiehte zuilou khu mi zuou ahi a, tualeh thutah ama ah a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh A thuzui pouma khu ama ah Pasian itna abukim tahtah hi, tami’n Ama ah i um chi i thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama ah ka um chi mi’n Ama gamtat banga agamtat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Unaute aw, noute kungah thupieh tha ka hing giel sih a, thupieh lui achiil a na neisa uh ka hing giel zaw ahi. Tua thupieh lui pen achiil apat na zahsa uh thu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachiengleh thupieh tha khat na kung uah ka hing giel kia hi, tua khu Ama leh noute ah dihtahin a um hi, aziehpen Miel abeita a, vah dihtah ahing taangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Min vah ah ka um chi ngal a, aunau amuda leh, tutanin miel ah a um nalai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aunau it mi pen vah ah a um a, tualeh ama ah kipalpua theina mawng mawng a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh aunau muda pouma miel a um ahi a, mielin amit atosah a apeina lam zong athei sih hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ta ittahte aw, Ama min zieha na khelnate uh, ngaidam ahitaah ziehin, na kung uah ka hing giel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pate aw, achiila pat a um Ama na thei ziehun, na kung uah ka giel ahi. Tangvalte aw, giloupa na zawtaah zieh, un na kung uah ka giel ahi. Tate aw Pa na theitah zieh un, na kung uah ka giel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pate aw, achiil a kipat a um Ama na theitah, ziehun na kung uah ka giel ahi. Tangvalte aw na hat ua, Pasian thu nouma ah um ngitnget a, tualeh giloupa na zawtaah ziehun, na kung uah ka giel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Leitung it sih unlen, leitunga sil umte zong it sih un, mi koipouin leitung a it leh, Pa itna ama ah a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen leitunga sil um zousie tahsa utnate, mit utnate leh damsung kiletsahnate khu Pasian akipan ahi sih a, leitunga kipan ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leitungpen a utna toh abeimang zel a, hinanleh Pasian deilam bawl mi pen kumtawnin aumden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ta ittahte aw, hun nukhia ahita, Khrist doudalpa ahing pei ding chi na zahtaah uh bangin, tuin zong Khrist doudalmi tampi a umta hi, tamte ziehin tu khu hun nukhia ahita chi ithei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amaute khu ilah ua kipat in apawtdoh ua, hinanleh ilah ua mi ahi sih uhi, aziehpen ilah ua mi na hita u’leh eite toh a umden ding ua, hinanleh a unpi ua apawtdohna un amaute khatbeeh zong eite lah a mi ahisih uh chi kilatna dingin apawtdoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh noute pen Mi Siengthoupa apat thaununa tang na hi ua, sil zousie na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thutah na theilou zieh ua na kung ua hing giel ka hi sih a, thutah na thei zieh u’leh thutah apat zuou apawtlou zieha hing giel ka hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesu khu Khrist ahi sih chia nielkal loungal zuou gen mi koi ahiei? Pa leh Tapa niel mi khu Khrist doudal ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi koipou Tapa nuol miin Pa anei sih a, hinanleh Tapa pom pouma in Pa zong anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaziehin achiil a pata na zahsa u’khu nouma ah umsah un. Tua achiil a pat a na zah u’khu nouma a aum ngitnget nahpou leh noute zong Tapa leh Pa ah na um ngitnget ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh tami ahi Aman eite ahing chiemsa: kumtawn hinna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Noute hing sol tumte tungtang ah tam thute ka hing giel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh Ama akipat thaununa na tan u’khu nouma ah aum ngitnget a, koima hing hil na kiphamaw sih uhi, hinanleh tua thaununa mama in noute sil zousie ahing hil hi, tua thaununa pen adihtah ahia, zuou ahi sih hi. Ahing hil bangin Ama ah na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuin ta ittahte aw, Ama ah um ngitnget un, Ama ahing kilat chienga kimuonna inei theina ding leh Ama ahing pei chienga Amai a izum louna dingun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama khu mi dihtat ahi chi na thei u’leh, michin dihtatna bawl pouma Ama a pieng ahi chi na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai un, Pa hing itna thupi hina va-ia e, Pasian tate chia i um taah uh. Tuaziehin leitungin ahing thei sih hi, Ama atheilou zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ittahte aw, tuin eite Pasian tate i hita uhi, tualeh bangchibanga um ding i hiei chi akilang nai tadi sih hi, hinanleh Ama ahing kilat chiengin Ama bangin i um ding uh chi pen ithei uhi, Ama pen ahina bangbanga imu ding zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh michin Ama a kinepna nei pouma, Ama asienthou bangin akisusiengthou zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi Koipou khelna bawlin dan abawtsie hi; khelna khu danbei a gamtatna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I khelnate lamang ding a Ama hing kilang ahi chi na thei uhi, Ama ah khelna mawngmawng a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Koipou Ama a um ngitnget mi pen akhiel sih hi. Khelna bawl mi koipou in Ama amu sih a, thei zong athei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ta ittahte aw, noute koiman hing solzou sih heh. Ama adihtat bangin, dihtatna bawl mi khu, midihtat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khelna bawl mi khu diabol akipat ahia, aziehpen diabol in achiila kipat in akhiel tawntung hi. Pasian Tapa ahing kilatna zieh pen diabol nasepte suse dingin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi koipou Pasian a pieng poumain khelna abawl ngaisih hi, aziehpen Pasian chii ama ah a um ngitnget a, Pasian a pieng ahiziehin khelna abawl thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tam thu a kipat in Pasian tate leh diabol tate akithei thei hi; dihtat taha gamtalou mi pouma Pasian akipat ahi sih a, tualeh aunau itlou mi pouma zong Pasian akipat ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Achiil a kipata thuhah na zah u’khu tami ahi; eite khat leh khat iki ittuo chiet ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Giloupa a kipan asanggampa that Kain bang lou in: Bangzieh a atha ahiei? ama silbawlte ahoi sih a, asanggampa adihtat zieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka unaute aw, leitung miten noute ahing muda leh lamdang sasih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I unaute i it ziehin shina apat hinna ah i lutta chi ithei uhi. Mi koipou aunau itlou khu shina ah a umden hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi koipou aunau muda khu tuolthat ahi; tuolthat koima kumtawn hinna neiden a um sih chi na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tanah Pasian itna i thei uhi, Aman eite dinga ahinna apiehkhiet ziehin, eiten zong unaute ding a i hinna i pieh sam ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh mi koipou in leitung nei leh lam hau henlen, a unau tasamin muhenlen, ama lainat vawt sih leh bangchi’n Pasian itna ama ah a um thei diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka ta ittahte aw, athu maimai leh kamsiemin ki it sih vai, hinanleh nasep silbawl leh thutah in ki it zaw vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tam thu apat in thutah a kipan i hi uh i thei a, tualeh Ama mai ah i lungtang uh i muongsah thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I lungtang un siemlou ahing tansah leh, Pasian khu i lungtang sang un athupi zaw a, sil zousie athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />It tahte aw, i lungtang un siemlou ahing tansah sihpou leh Pasian lam ah kimuonna inei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Athupiehte i zui a, amitmu a Ama lungkimna lam i bawl ziehin i nget pouma Ama apat i mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Athupieh khu tami ahi, eiten A Tapa Jesu Khrist min i gintat ua, tualeh ahing thupieh banga khat leh khat iki it tuo chiet ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi koipou athupieh zui khu Ama ah aum a, Ama zong ama ah aum hi. Tam thu akipat Ama pen eite ah a um zing hi chi, Ahing pieh Hagau zal in ithei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />It leh ngaite aw, hagau chinteng gingta sih unlen, hagaute khu Pasian a hing kipan ahileh hilou chien zaw un, aziehpen guolnei tahlou tampi leitungah apawtdoh zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tam thu ah Pasian Hagau na thei ding uhi: Jesu Khrist tahsa in ahing pieng chia phuong hagau pouma khu Pasian a kipan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu Khrist tahsa in ahing pieng chia phuonglou hagau pouma Pasian a hing kipan ahisih hi, tampen Khrist doudalpa hagau hing pei ding ahi chia na zah u’khu ahi, tuin zong leitungah a um zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ta it leh ngaite aw, noute pen Pasiana kipan na hi ua, amauh na zouta uhi; aziehpen Ama nouma a umpa khu leitunga umpa sangin athupi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amauh pen leitunga kipan ahi ua, tuaziehin leitung silte agen uhi, tualeh leitungin amauh angaikhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eite pen Pasian akipan i hi ua, Pasian thei mi pouma in ithugen angaikhie uhi. Pasiana kipan hilouten i thugen angaikhe sih uhi. Tanah hagau dih leh dihlou ithei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />It tahte aw, khat leh khat iki it ding uhi, aziehpen itna khu Pasiana kipan ahi, tualeh michin itna nei pouma Pasian apieng ahia, Pasian athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Itna neilou mi in, Pasian athei sih hi, aziehpen Pasian khu itna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tanah, Pasian in a itna eite lamah ahing langsahta, Ama zal a ihin theina dingin Pasian in A Tapa neisun leitunga ahing sawlna ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tanah itna a um hi, eiten Pasian i it chi ahi sih a, Ama neite ahing it a, i khelnate thuphatawina hi dingin A Tapa ahing sawl chi ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />It tahte aw, Pasian in hichikhopa ahing it leh, eite zong khat leh khat iki it ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi koiman bangmachihin zong Pasian amu ngai sih hi. Eite khat leh khat iki it leh, Pasian eima ah a uma, A itna zong eima ah abukim ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tanah eite Ama ah i um a, Ama zong eima ah a um chi ithei hi; A Hagau ahing pieh taah ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Pa in Tapa khu leitung hundampa dingin ahing sawl chi i muta ua, i theisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi koipou Jesu Pasian Tapa ahi chia phuong pouma khu ama ah Pasian a um a, ama zong Pasian ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh i tunga Pasian in itna anei khu ithei ua, ging zong i gingta uhi. Pasian khu itna ahia, koipou itna a um khu Pasian ah a uma, Pasian zong ama ah aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tanah ilah uah itna abukimta hi, thukhen ni chienga hansanna i nei theina dingun, Ama hina bangbanga leitunga eite hina zong ahitah ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Itna ah zauna a um sih a, itna bukimin zauna anotmang zaw hi, aziehpen zaunain gawtna ahing ngaituosah hi; zauna nei mi khu itna ah abukim nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman eite ahing it masah zieh a, eiten Ama i it uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi koiahiei in “Pasian ka it” chi ngal a aunau amuda leh ama mi zuou ahi, amu giaguo aunau bawn it loupi’n amulou Pasian bangchi’n a it thei diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama a kipat tam thupieh eiten inei uhi, Koipou Pasian it in, aunau zong a it ding ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi koipou Jesu khu Khrist ahi chi gingta khu Pasian a pieng ahia, tualeh koipou ahingtu it in ata zong a it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tanah Pasian i it a, athupiehte izuina ah, Pasian tate i it hi chi i thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasian i itna khu athupiehte izuina uh ahi, tualeh athupiehte pen azui hasa vawt sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasian a pieng pouma in leitung pumpi azouta hi; tualeh tami ahi leitung pumpi izawna uh; i ginna uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesu Pasian Tapa ahi chi gingta mi loungal koi ahiei leitung pumpi tunga guolzou?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tami ahi tui leh sisan a hing pei, Jesu Khrist khu; tui guoh hilou in tui leh sisan in ahizaw hi. Tualeh theipipa khu Hagau ahi, aziehpen Hagau khu thutah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen van ah theipitu thum a um hi, Pa, Thu, tualeh Hagau Siengthou, tualeh tam thumte pen khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh leitungah theipitu thum a um hi, Hagau, tui, leh sisan, tualeh thumte khat bangin akithukim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mihing theipina bawn i pom u’leh, Pasian theipina athupi zaw hi, Pasian theipina khu A Tapa tungthu a atheisahna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Koipou Pasian Tapa gingtain ama ah theipimi hina anei hi, koipou Pasian thu gingtalou miin pen. Ama mi zuou ahisah hi; Pasian in a Tapa ahing pieh thu atheisah agintatlou zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh tami theipina khu ahi, Pasian in kumtawn hinna eite ahing peta a, tua hinna khu A Tapa ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Koipou Tapa nei in hinna aneita, Pasian Tapa neilou poumain hinna anei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumtawn hinna na neita uh chi na theina dingun, noute Pasian min gingtate kungah tam thu ka giel ahi, tualeh Pasian Tapa min na gintat theina dingun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasian a i kimuonna u’khu tami ahi, Ama deilam sil khat poupou i nget leh ahing ngaikhe zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman inget pouma ahing ngaikhie chi ithei chiengin, akunga ingette uh imuta chi ithei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi koipou in asanggam in shina khop hilou khelna bawla amu leh, athumpieh dinga tuachi’n Aman shina khop hilou khelna bawlte dingin hinna ape ding hi. Shina tunthei khelna aum a, tuami a dingin athumpieh ding ahi ka chi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dihtatlouna zousie khelna ahi; shina khop hilou khelna zong a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Koipou Pasiana kipat a pieng khu akhiel zongsang sih chi ithei hi, hinanleh Pasian a piengpa in ama akembit a, giloupa’n ama akhoi kha sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Eite Pasian a ihi chi ikithei a, leitung pumpi giloupa thunuoi ah a um hi chi ithei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian Tapa ahing pei a, Midihpa Ama itheina dingin theisiemna ahing peta chi ithei uhi; eite pen tua Midihtah a Tapa Jesu Khrist mama ah i um uhi. Ama khu Pasian dihtah leh kumtawn hinna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ta ittahte aw, milimte apat kihemkhie un. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
